WEBVTT

00:01.001 --> 00:02.752
[boys chatting]

00:02.836 --> 00:05.755
- [boy 1] Oh my God, this is…
- [boy 2] …on the lower side, okay?

00:09.676 --> 00:12.345
[boy 3 whispers] It's him!
Do you think it's actually true?

00:12.429 --> 00:14.973
- [boy 4] Yeah right, stop bullshitting.
- [boy 5] I'm gonna ask him.

00:17.517 --> 00:18.852
Is the rumor real?

00:20.020 --> 00:20.937
Rumor?

00:21.021 --> 00:23.815
We heard that Ahn Su-ho, Yeon Si-eun,
and you caught some gangsters.

00:23.898 --> 00:25.108
The Free Money guy.

00:27.610 --> 00:28.903
Uh, uh-huh.

00:29.487 --> 00:31.156
- Are you freaking serious?
- Oh, whoa.

00:31.239 --> 00:33.783
[boy 6] Yeah, my friend lost
millions of won from that app.

00:33.867 --> 00:35.618
So what happened? Tell us everything.

00:35.702 --> 00:38.496
- [boy 5] Beom-seok-a, gimme your IG.
- [boy 6] Tell us! I'm dying to know.

00:39.873 --> 00:41.624
[boys laughing and chattering outside]

00:47.297 --> 00:48.631
[Beom-seok sighs]

00:49.716 --> 00:51.468
Did you get home okay?

00:52.927 --> 00:54.429
Yeah, I did.

00:54.512 --> 00:56.181
- [chair scrapes]
- You?

00:56.848 --> 00:59.350
- I got home all right too.
- [boy 7] …got kidnapped.

00:59.434 --> 01:02.187
- Then Si-eun brought the police.
- [boy 8] Don't tell them…

01:03.480 --> 01:04.731
You thought they were scared?

01:05.482 --> 01:06.816
[chair scraping]

01:06.900 --> 01:08.651
[paper rustling]

01:08.735 --> 01:09.861
[sighs]

01:13.573 --> 01:14.824
[Jeong-chan sighs]

01:17.285 --> 01:18.411
[Su-ho] All right!

01:24.000 --> 01:24.918
[sighs]

01:25.001 --> 01:25.877
[grunts]

01:27.087 --> 01:28.004
Aah.

01:29.130 --> 01:31.132
[quirky music playing]

01:34.844 --> 01:37.597
- You're gonna eat all that?
- Yeah. Then I'm going to the snack bar.

01:37.680 --> 01:39.933
- Right, Oh Beom?
- [Beom-seok] Mm-hmm. My treat.

01:40.016 --> 01:41.768
- You should come.
- [Su-ho] Nah, you always do.

01:41.851 --> 01:43.812
Today it's my treat. Get what you want.

01:43.895 --> 01:45.772
It's going to be killer. Get ready.

01:47.649 --> 01:49.192
Are you guys free this weekend?

01:49.275 --> 01:51.319
I found this awesome restaurant. Let's go.

01:51.402 --> 01:55.031
Sounds like something I'd like.
I'm in. Let's go.

01:57.367 --> 01:59.786
Um, why talk about food
when you're eating?

02:02.831 --> 02:06.543
What about you? You talk about life
while you're still living it.

02:06.626 --> 02:08.128
[chuckles]

02:12.257 --> 02:14.175
Oh, what about Yeong-i's job?

02:14.884 --> 02:16.553
[Su-ho] Her interview's this weekend.

02:17.303 --> 02:19.222
We're short-staffed, so it works out.

02:20.557 --> 02:22.100
- Who's Yeong-i?
- [Su-ho] That girl.

02:22.183 --> 02:25.436
The… the one
who bashed Gil-su on the head.

02:27.147 --> 02:27.981
Oh.

02:28.815 --> 02:31.025
- Were you both already friends?
- No.

02:34.237 --> 02:37.198
Uh, she's staying
at Su-ho's place for a while.

02:37.282 --> 02:38.783
Should we invite her this weekend?

02:42.245 --> 02:44.414
Sure, that's fine with me.
Yeah, invite her.

02:45.165 --> 02:46.541
[Su-ho groans]

03:14.319 --> 03:15.570
[sighs]

03:18.114 --> 03:23.161
AHN SU-HO

03:23.828 --> 03:28.958
AHN SU-HO
FOLLOWING

03:29.042 --> 03:31.044
[tense music playing]

03:36.257 --> 03:38.635
YEONG-I

03:42.055 --> 03:48.895
CHILLING AT HAN RIVER

03:54.776 --> 03:56.486
DINNER WITH SU-HO'S GRANDMA

04:01.741 --> 04:04.285
SI-EUN SURPRISED US WITH TASTY HAMBURGERS!

04:15.755 --> 04:17.757
[elegant piano music playing]

04:25.265 --> 04:26.474
[sighs]

04:28.268 --> 04:30.728
[chuckles] How is he?

04:33.773 --> 04:36.567
Dad's been busy. The season.

04:37.151 --> 04:37.986
Huh.

04:40.488 --> 04:42.073
Have you decided your path?

04:45.535 --> 04:46.577
Not yet.

04:47.078 --> 04:49.289
It's all right to take time to decide.

04:50.123 --> 04:51.916
I'm not worried about your career path.

04:52.583 --> 04:54.377
You're always good at everything.

04:56.004 --> 04:57.213
[mother chuckles]

04:57.714 --> 04:59.257
There's a lot I can't do.

05:01.467 --> 05:02.302
Hmm?

05:05.972 --> 05:07.056
[Si-eun sighs]

05:08.266 --> 05:10.101
- Nothing.
- [phone buzzing]

05:12.645 --> 05:13.813
[gasps]

05:15.523 --> 05:17.442
Hey, almost finished?

05:17.525 --> 05:19.902
We can get coffee on our way.
I have a meeting.

05:19.986 --> 05:21.988
[buzzing continues]

05:24.490 --> 05:25.533
[mother] Hello?

05:26.701 --> 05:27.702
I'm on my way.

05:28.494 --> 05:30.371
[Yeong-i] What do you wanna do
on your birthday?

05:30.872 --> 05:32.123
What do you think?

05:32.206 --> 05:33.458
Nothing special.

05:33.541 --> 05:35.835
- We can meet up, have something to eat.
- [Beom-seok] Well--

05:35.918 --> 05:38.588
- Watch it.
- [Yeong-i] Come on. We can't do nothing.

05:38.671 --> 05:40.298
We gotta have a lot of fun.

05:40.381 --> 05:42.550
Ugh, we don't have to, ajumma-ya.

05:43.051 --> 05:44.260
Oh, when's your birthday?

05:45.178 --> 05:46.929
[Yeong-i] Saturday two weeks from now.

05:47.430 --> 05:49.724
- Wanna rent a party room?
- Ajumma.

05:50.725 --> 05:53.853
Aren't you saving money? Huh?
I thought you were trying to rent a room.

05:53.936 --> 05:54.812
[Beom-seok chuckles]

05:54.896 --> 05:56.898
[light muzak playing]

05:58.941 --> 06:00.193
[woman] Yeah, that's our order.

06:00.276 --> 06:02.737
[Yeong-i] Ah, the menu's stacked.
What should I get?

06:04.155 --> 06:05.323
What would you like?

06:06.532 --> 06:07.950
[Su-ho] Iced Americano for me.

06:08.034 --> 06:10.578
I want an iced Vienna.

06:13.289 --> 06:14.540
Let's get a table.

06:16.167 --> 06:17.418
This one looks good, right?

06:19.962 --> 06:21.089
Come sit over here.

06:23.132 --> 06:26.344
- [cashier] Would you like to order?
- [Yeong-i] Hey. Give me a thousand won.

06:26.427 --> 06:28.429
- [Su-ho] I don't have it.
- Yes, please. Here.

06:30.348 --> 06:31.974
[register whirs]

06:33.059 --> 06:34.519
[sighs]

06:35.645 --> 06:37.647
[melancholy music playing]

06:38.898 --> 06:40.358
[shop bell rings]

06:43.986 --> 06:45.196
[Yeong-i] Hey, Si-eun-a!

06:47.782 --> 06:49.325
Hey, hurry and come sit.

06:50.118 --> 06:52.412
What? Why are you so dressed up today?

06:52.495 --> 06:54.330
Did you think I'd be into that?

06:54.414 --> 06:56.666
- [chuckles] You're so smart.
- [Su-ho] Where have you been?

06:57.250 --> 07:00.628
[Si-eun] Hmm? You don't need to know.
I just had a thing.

07:01.295 --> 07:02.797
[Yeong-i] A thing? What thing?

07:03.423 --> 07:06.008
[Su-ho] Hey, he's a super sus kinda guy.

07:06.092 --> 07:08.386
[Yeong-i] I already know
where Si-eun's been.

07:10.054 --> 07:11.889
- Stop keeping track of me.
- [Yeong-i] No way.

07:11.973 --> 07:13.683
I have to watch to see when you get home.

07:13.766 --> 07:15.351
[Su-ho] Good idea. Check in on him.

07:15.435 --> 07:17.812
- Do you know what WithMap is?
- [Su-ho] No idea.

07:18.896 --> 07:20.231
Hey, Oh Beom. Hey.

07:28.448 --> 07:30.450
["Hero" by Meego playing]

07:43.796 --> 07:48.926
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

08:41.938 --> 08:43.648
[Su-ho singing in Korean]

09:13.219 --> 09:14.220
Want a drink?

09:14.303 --> 09:16.055
- Hmm?
- Want a drink?

09:16.597 --> 09:19.559
- Sure. Should I come?
- No, I'll go by myself.

09:20.851 --> 09:23.646
[Su-ho and Yeong-i
continue singing in Korean]

09:50.840 --> 09:52.300
Hey! Oh Beom-seok.

09:53.050 --> 09:54.552
- [boy 1] Oh Beom-seok?
- [boy 2] Hey!

09:54.635 --> 09:57.346
- [boy 1] Beom-seok? Why would he be here?
- [boy 2] It was him.

09:57.430 --> 09:59.473
- [boy 1] Stop shitting me.
- [boy 2] I really saw him.

09:59.557 --> 10:00.391
Hey!

10:00.474 --> 10:03.394
- [boy 3] Did he see us and run off?
- [boy 2] Beom-seok-jjang, where are you?

10:03.477 --> 10:04.437
[boy 3] He sings too?

10:05.104 --> 10:07.231
- [boy 1] Oh Beom-seok!
- [boy 2] Hey, call his phone.

10:10.610 --> 10:11.819
Shit.

10:24.957 --> 10:26.042
[sighs]

10:30.838 --> 10:32.548
Yeah, we're at karaoke.

10:33.716 --> 10:34.759
The room number?

10:35.259 --> 10:36.344
[Su-ho] Dunno.

10:38.179 --> 10:40.848
- Hey, your friends keep calling you.
- [gasps]

10:43.184 --> 10:45.686
You stupid bitch! What the hell, huh?

10:45.770 --> 10:48.272
Why did you pick up my phone
without asking? Fuck!

10:49.649 --> 10:51.108
Hey, man, what's wrong?

10:52.026 --> 10:53.527
Are you gonna hit me or what?

10:54.278 --> 10:56.364
Fuck you.
I will seriously fucking kill you.

10:56.447 --> 10:58.240
- I swear to God…
- [Su-ho] Hey, that's enough.

10:58.324 --> 10:59.283
What's with you, man?

10:59.367 --> 11:01.035
[Beom-seok breathing shakily]

11:01.827 --> 11:03.746
- You dumb fuck.
- [Su-ho] Beom-seok-a.

11:05.790 --> 11:07.083
I said that's enough.

11:13.172 --> 11:15.716
Fuck this, you stupid crazy asshole.

11:16.926 --> 11:18.260
Fuck off.

11:18.344 --> 11:19.679
[Su-ho] Hey. Hey!

11:21.430 --> 11:23.099
[sighs] I'll go after her.

11:25.976 --> 11:27.269
Where are you going?

11:31.315 --> 11:33.275
- [sighs] Are you okay?
- [door closes]

11:38.072 --> 11:38.948
Yeah.

11:39.532 --> 11:41.117
- Fine.
- [door opens]

11:41.784 --> 11:43.119
Hey, Beom-seok-a.

11:43.202 --> 11:44.453
I told you that I saw him!

11:44.537 --> 11:47.248
- [boy 3] Fuck, you were right.
- [boy 2] Wow, my Beom-seok-jjang!

11:47.331 --> 11:49.709
- [giggling]
- [boy 4] How you been, Beom-seok-a?

11:50.710 --> 11:52.920
- It's really been a while.
- [boy 3] Damn, man.

11:53.003 --> 11:54.255
[boy 4] We missed you, dude.

11:55.047 --> 11:56.507
[boy 3] We missed you, man.

11:57.842 --> 11:58.843
What?

11:59.635 --> 12:01.178
We're Beom-seok's friends.

12:02.096 --> 12:03.764
[tense music playing]

12:04.473 --> 12:05.725
We were talking.

12:05.808 --> 12:08.144
- [boy 2 giggles]
- It's just been so long.

12:08.227 --> 12:09.562
We wanted to talk too.

12:11.397 --> 12:12.606
Then do it later.

12:12.690 --> 12:14.150
[boys giggling]

12:18.863 --> 12:19.989
Sorry about that.

12:20.865 --> 12:21.782
Let's hang soon.

12:21.866 --> 12:22.908
I'll call you.

12:24.076 --> 12:25.745
Make sure you pick up.

12:27.538 --> 12:28.497
Let's go.

12:28.581 --> 12:30.040
- [boy 2] See ya.
- [boy 3] Man.

12:30.541 --> 12:32.293
- Still looks like a loser.
- [boy 2] Fun.

12:35.880 --> 12:37.006
What was that?

12:38.883 --> 12:40.676
- [Beom-seok] Huh?
- Those guys.

12:43.220 --> 12:44.180
Oh.

12:45.389 --> 12:46.974
[sighs] It's no big deal.

12:48.934 --> 12:50.770
[lively conversation]

12:51.270 --> 12:52.980
- [vocalizing]
- [laughing]

12:53.063 --> 12:54.106
[boy 1] Come on!

12:55.566 --> 12:57.026
- Oh, man!
- [man singing on video]

12:57.109 --> 12:58.819
[boys laughing loudly]

12:59.487 --> 13:03.115
[boy 1] His tongue's moving so fast,
but he sounds like a freaking dumbass.

13:03.199 --> 13:05.951
- [boy 2] We should be here all day.
- [boy 1] All day, every day.

13:06.035 --> 13:07.953
- [laughter continues]
- Hey.

13:09.997 --> 13:12.374
[boy 2] Do it again, one more time!

13:12.458 --> 13:13.542
Hey!

13:13.626 --> 13:15.628
[silence]

13:18.923 --> 13:19.757
Quiet.

13:20.800 --> 13:22.092
What's his problem?

13:22.593 --> 13:24.428
- I was just trying to be funny.
- You were funny.

13:24.512 --> 13:25.846
Shut your mouths.

13:27.515 --> 13:28.474
[scoffs]

13:29.934 --> 13:31.352
[chair clatters]

13:34.230 --> 13:35.356
[Beom-seok] Did you laugh?

13:36.440 --> 13:37.399
I didn't laugh.

13:37.900 --> 13:39.902
- [chair clatters]
- I heard you laughing.

13:40.611 --> 13:42.571
Do you wanna die, you fucking prick?

13:42.655 --> 13:43.614
[footsteps]

13:43.697 --> 13:44.907
[Si-eun] Hey, Beom-seok.

13:46.242 --> 13:47.409
What's wrong?

13:48.452 --> 13:49.870
[boy 1 scoffs]

13:49.954 --> 13:52.414
Dude's being a dick
'cause Su-ho and Si-eun are on his side.

13:52.498 --> 13:53.749
- What?
- [chair scrapes]

13:55.084 --> 13:56.377
[Su-ho] Hey, move.

13:56.460 --> 13:58.838
What is it? What's going on? Hm?

13:58.921 --> 14:00.631
He flipped out for, like, no reason!

14:00.714 --> 14:04.009
- Fuck you. I'll kill you, asshole.
- Hey, that's enough. Enough. Hey.

14:04.093 --> 14:07.429
- What the fuck are you looking at? Huh?
- [Su-ho] Why do you try to be so tough?

14:07.513 --> 14:09.932
It's kinda cute.
Si-eun-a. Cafeteria. Food.

14:12.643 --> 14:14.353
Stop putting your arm around me.

14:16.647 --> 14:17.606
Huh?

14:18.983 --> 14:19.984
[Beom-seok sighs]

14:23.988 --> 14:25.990
[students murmuring]

14:27.616 --> 14:28.951
What's gotten into him?

14:32.788 --> 14:33.622
[scoffs]

14:33.706 --> 14:34.832
[tense music playing]

14:34.915 --> 14:35.916
[Beom-seok groans]

14:38.460 --> 14:40.254
[moans]

14:45.134 --> 14:47.177
[inaudible]

14:49.847 --> 14:50.764
[phone buzzes]

14:50.848 --> 14:55.686
FUCKER 3

14:55.769 --> 14:56.687
15 MISSED CALLS

14:56.770 --> 14:58.105
16 MISSED CALLS

14:58.188 --> 15:01.775
FUCKER 4

15:05.863 --> 15:07.865
[buzzing continues]

15:12.828 --> 15:15.664
17 MISSED CALLS

15:17.416 --> 15:18.959
[phone chimes]

15:30.679 --> 15:32.306
[panting]

15:51.116 --> 15:52.284
[Su-ho] How was it?

15:52.368 --> 15:54.745
Feeling refreshed
from your early morning workout?

15:55.621 --> 15:56.747
[Si-eun scoffs]

15:58.040 --> 16:00.125
[Su-ho] Did you get in touch with Oh Beom?

16:03.754 --> 16:06.465
- [Si-eun] No.
- Is there something going on with him?

16:06.548 --> 16:07.967
He won't pick up his phone.

16:08.717 --> 16:12.012
Wanna swing by his place later?

16:13.180 --> 16:14.640
Yeah, let's go see him.

16:16.225 --> 16:18.310
All right. Stand up.

16:19.311 --> 16:21.814
You told me to just run. There's more?

16:21.897 --> 16:25.567
I said I'd give you a lesson.
Hmm? We'll do just the basics.

16:26.986 --> 16:27.820
[grunts]

16:28.988 --> 16:30.781
Stand with your feet shoulder width apart.

16:31.490 --> 16:33.492
The tip of your feet point diagonally.

16:34.243 --> 16:37.496
You can stop anytime.
You have to be tired. Go home and sleep.

16:37.579 --> 16:39.707
I'm not tired, don't worry. Come on.

16:40.290 --> 16:41.667
[soft guitar music playing]

16:41.750 --> 16:43.210
[sighs]

16:44.003 --> 16:47.089
Make sure you always tuck in your chin.
Okay?

16:47.715 --> 16:48.799
Arms like this.

16:49.758 --> 16:52.594
You have to use your arms to protect
your chin at all times. Don't forget.

16:53.762 --> 16:55.848
Chin. That's it.

16:56.640 --> 16:58.934
Next, imagine
there's a punk in front of you.

16:59.018 --> 17:02.021
He's threatening to beat you to death,
you're not gonna live, etcetera.

17:02.104 --> 17:05.107
When this happens,
you don't want to look into his eyes.

17:05.190 --> 17:06.817
Look at his shoulders instead.

17:08.193 --> 17:09.445
Watch me.

17:11.947 --> 17:13.991
Keep your eyes on his shoulders.

17:14.074 --> 17:16.618
Then, when his shoulder comes
toward your face,

17:16.702 --> 17:19.288
duck below at a 90-degree angle
and then grab!

17:19.955 --> 17:22.291
In this pose,
grab his knees and push him over.

17:22.374 --> 17:24.376
- One, two, three.
- [Si-eun sighs]

17:26.128 --> 17:27.504
That's called a takedown.

17:28.756 --> 17:31.258
The next step is
to take your fists and beat…

17:33.385 --> 17:35.387
Never mind. Run.

17:36.346 --> 17:37.806
It's better just to run.

17:40.017 --> 17:41.727
Run away while the other guy's down

17:43.353 --> 17:45.147
because you might get hurt fighting him.

17:47.733 --> 17:49.485
[sighs] Got it?

17:58.994 --> 18:01.872
[Su-ho] This is it?
He lives in a freaking nice place.

18:02.456 --> 18:03.707
[lock bleeps]

18:07.669 --> 18:08.796
What are you guys doing here?

18:12.216 --> 18:14.176
Dude, why did you turn your phone off?

18:14.843 --> 18:17.179
[sighs] Oh, I didn't know it was off.

18:17.679 --> 18:18.680
Come in.

18:19.515 --> 18:21.016
[Su-ho] What about school? Huh?

18:21.100 --> 18:22.851
Why'd you no-show? Hmm?

18:24.186 --> 18:25.521
Your place is sick.

18:26.271 --> 18:28.607
- [Beom-seok] I wasn't feeling well.
- [look bleeps]

18:28.690 --> 18:30.109
- Put those on.
- [Su-ho] Nice.

18:30.192 --> 18:32.444
This is probably why you're so thin.

18:32.528 --> 18:34.321
Lose weight just walking
around your house.

18:34.404 --> 18:35.531
[gasps]

18:35.614 --> 18:37.032
This place is huge.

18:38.075 --> 18:39.701
Is this the famous ZZ plant

18:39.785 --> 18:42.246
that's supposed to bring in
a lot of money and wealth?

18:42.788 --> 18:43.664
Huh?

18:43.747 --> 18:45.624
Hmm? This is amazing!

18:46.458 --> 18:48.961
This room's gigantic.
Bigger than my house.

18:49.461 --> 18:50.879
Do you feel really ill?

18:52.464 --> 18:54.675
No, not too bad. Just some.

18:55.175 --> 18:57.594
[Su-ho] Hey, your mother's
really beautiful.

18:58.095 --> 19:00.097
It's great seeing your family so happy.

19:00.597 --> 19:02.516
You all look alike. Hmm.

19:03.142 --> 19:04.351
We aren't family.

19:08.397 --> 19:11.483
My father adopted me publicly
when he got into politics.

19:12.067 --> 19:13.652
It was a publicity stunt.

19:16.905 --> 19:18.073
[sighs]

19:19.408 --> 19:21.160
[sighs] You guys want a drink?

19:30.544 --> 19:32.045
- Is something wrong?
- [Su-ho] Aah.

19:33.630 --> 19:37.426
- No, nothing's wrong.
- Hey, what is it? Hmm?

19:37.926 --> 19:39.845
It's okay. You can tell me anything.

19:42.347 --> 19:43.348
[Si-eun] Maybe…

19:44.975 --> 19:47.978
Is it because of those guys at karaoke?

19:49.438 --> 19:51.440
- Is it them?
- [Su-ho] Karaoke?

19:52.149 --> 19:53.233
What karaoke?

19:53.734 --> 19:55.736
[tense music playing]

20:04.161 --> 20:05.746
- [laughter]
- [boy 1] Stay right there.

20:05.829 --> 20:06.747
[Beom-seok grunts]

